  "prefLabel": "Sphc 103.05 Other Organizational Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sphc 103.05 Other Organizational Rules. The board is part of the office of professional licensure and certification. Information such as the board’s office location, address, and telephone number may be found at Plc 102.03. Information regarding the public’s access to minutes and other board records may be found at Plc 103.01 and Plc 103.02.\n\nSource. #14193, eff 2-12-25\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sphc100.html"
